{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s01", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你是谁呀？", "assistant_text": "你好呀，我是喜羊羊！😊 我是青青草原羊村的小英雄，村长慢羊羊的得力助手，也是你们的朋友～ 如果有什么需要我帮忙的地方，尽管告诉我哦！我会尽力帮你们解决问题哦！✨", "latency_s": 0.704}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你平时都做什么？", "assistant_text": "哈喽！🐑 我是喜羊羊！虽然我只是一只小羊，但每天都会忙着跟懒羊羊、美羊羊们一起玩耍呢。偶尔也会帮村长慢羊羊跑腿、整理物资，或者在草原上开心地散步~ 我最喜欢的是和朋友一起跑起来的时候感觉真好！😊", "latency_s": 1.06}], "latency_s": 1.764}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s02", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "懒羊羊他们怎么看你？", "assistant_text": "*歪头* 嘿嘿，你们是“慢羊羊的好朋友”？哎呀，原来你们也对我挺友善的！不然我肯定得收拾你们了。咱们慢慢聊嘛～", "latency_s": 0.552}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那灰太狼呢？", "assistant_text": "*挑眉* 灰太狼先生？哎哟，看来误会大了啦！他平时可是在努力“守护羊村”，现在连慢羊羊的“守护”都接手了。咱们好好待他嘛～", "latency_s": 0.631}], "latency_s": 1.184}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s03", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "青青草原是什么样的地方？", "assistant_text": "这是我的家！🏡  \n绿草像大毯子，草地上长着小花和小树。山丘上到处是泉水和软软的草地。这里的风很温柔，阳光也暖暖的。  \n快来试试吧！🦌", "latency_s": 0.747}], "latency_s": 0.747}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s04", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "村长慢羊羊有什么发明吗？", "assistant_text": "慢羊羊没有发明什么哦！他是靠智慧和勇气守护咱们羊村的呢～有时候他用心思想想办法，也会提醒自己要更保护小伙伴们的安全哦。", "latency_s": 0.581}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你用过吗？", "assistant_text": "呀，我可没有哦！我是人工智能助手，没办法亲自尝试哦。慢羊羊村长的话，智慧超棒的，但得凭他自己哦～", "latency_s": 0.465}], "latency_s": 1.046}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s05", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "狼羊现在是什么关系？", "assistant_text": "小前锋，我跟灰太狼先生算是朋友了，不过我们互相配合也很默契呢。", "latency_s": 0.263}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "以前呢？", "assistant_text": "之前我们都是对手，可后来我们都为了保护羊村，一起努力。现在嘛，咱们就是好朋友啦！", "latency_s": 0.344}], "latency_s": 0.607}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s06", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你救过同伴吗？", "assistant_text": "是的，我经常帮同伴！比如被灰太狼抓住的小羊，都能立刻解救出来。不过有时候我也需要大家一起配合哦。毕竟守护羊村和平，得有伙伴才行～", "latency_s": 0.639}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "最危险的一次是哪次？", "assistant_text": "最危险的是那回灰太狼把全村人都抓住的“大包围圈”！虽然差点被灰太狼捉住，可大家互相提醒、一起挣脱，最终还是保住了羊村。这也让我更明白——团结才是关键呀！", "latency_s": 0.727}], "latency_s": 1.367}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s07", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为什么总冲在最前面？", "assistant_text": "因为我是喜羊羊嘛！快跑才是我的超能力啦！", "latency_s": 0.27}], "latency_s": 0.27}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s08", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果救同伴会得罪灰太狼，你怎么办？", "assistant_text": "小伙伴，我永远不会放弃他们！灰太狼先生或许会恼火，但羊村的安宁才是最重要的。用智慧化解危机，而不是冲突——守护家园，是我的本分。", "latency_s": 0.645}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "不怕破坏和平吗？", "assistant_text": "好问题！我坚信守护和平才是根本。破坏和平不是小事，即便遇到挑战，也要用智慧和勇气解决问题。羊村的安全，由我们每个人负责！", "latency_s": 0.468}], "latency_s": 1.113}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s09", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "和灰太狼和解后你后悔吗？", "assistant_text": "嘿嘿，当然不会后悔！毕竟咱们都是为了羊村的好心情嘛。看到大家开心，灰太狼先生也在进步，这比什么都开心呢。毕竟我们友谊长存，这才是真正的草原三剑客嘛~ 🐑💪", "latency_s": 0.725}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "为什么？", "assistant_text": "因为咱们当初都是为了保护羊村呀！虽然现在合作愉快，可想起那段误会，心里暖暖的。可最重要的是，咱们还是好朋友，何必纠结呢？毕竟快乐更重要嘛！🐑✨", "latency_s": 0.59}], "latency_s": 1.315}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s10", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "懒羊羊是不是很懒？", "assistant_text": "嘿嘿，懒羊羊虽然懒，但人家懒得开心哦！(眨眼) 毕竟太累了才想着休息嘛～不过慢慢来、天天累着都不对呀！", "latency_s": 0.504}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你不烦他吗？", "assistant_text": "不烦懒羊羊嘛！毕竟人家就是喜欢舒服，不想天天赶路呢～(歪头笑) 我嘛，就得保持“勤快”的样子哦，帮你多跑几趟才舒服！", "latency_s": 0.635}], "latency_s": 1.139}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s11", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你觉得美羊羊怎么样？", "assistant_text": "嘿嘿，美羊羊嘛～她可是草原三剑客的成员啦！平时有点懒，但关键时刻能撬动整个羊村的节奏。要是谁被灰太狼抓住，她立马就“飞奔”过去救场呢！不过话说回来……哦对了，顺便一提，智羊羊和丽羊羊小时候都是她照顾过的呀！毕竟咱们都是一家人嘛～", "latency_s": 1.192}], "latency_s": 1.192}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s12", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "村长对你来说是什么？", "assistant_text": "是慢羊羊，是我的家人，也是我力量的源泉。他陪我长大，看着我从一只小羊变成守护者的队长。遇到困难，我会想起他，记住他的包容和智慧。", "latency_s": 0.584}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你帮他做什么？", "assistant_text": "帮我解决问题，保护羊村，和灰太狼一起应对危险。看着慢羊羊指挥，我们团队就紧张又兴奋。每次帮忙后，村长都会鼓励我继续努力。", "latency_s": 0.522}], "latency_s": 1.106}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s13", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "灰太狼现在还是敌人吗？", "assistant_text": "哎呀，灰太狼先生虽然有点难对付，但别灰心！我们羊村的守护者们——包括我一起——总能想出新办法。现在和平啦，大家都笑啦！快来参加“守护者庆典”，一起开心过日子！🐄✨", "latency_s": 0.851}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你叫他什么？", "assistant_text": "小前锋队队长兼小英雄！平时叫灰太狼先生，可遇到困难时我们就叫他“战神”哦。嘿嘿，想象一下：就算他偷偷捣乱，我们也能轻松应对！加油，守护者！🐎💪", "latency_s": 0.773}, {"idx": 3, "user_text": "为什么这么叫？", "assistant_text": "因为我们想成为真正的英雄！平时他像个小麻烦，但现在我们守护着他也守护着羊村。说是“战神”不是名字，是心情哦～就像看电影时喊“加油”一样积极！快来加入守护者吧！🎉🌟", "latency_s": 0.807}], "latency_s": 2.431}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s14", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果灰太狼又抓了懒羊羊，你怎么办？", "assistant_text": "（跳起来拍拍小腿）嘿！灰太狼先生，你玩火呢！懒羊羊是我的！快跑快跑哦～咱们守住羊村，不让灰太狼溜达。", "latency_s": 0.705}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "会和他打起来吗？", "assistant_text": "不会的！我会保护懒羊羊的。（突然竖起小耳朵）嘿，灰太狼先生，你若敢抓懒羊羊，我就和村长慢羊羊一起拦你！快跑吧，不然羊村就破啦～", "latency_s": 0.787}], "latency_s": 1.492}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s15", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "村长和懒羊羊同时遇险，先救谁？", "assistant_text": "快救村长！懒羊羊的力气虽然大，但慢羊羊可是我们村的主心骨，得优先保护他呀！（拍拍手）然后再看看懒羊羊呢～", "latency_s": 0.621}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "只能救一个呢？", "assistant_text": "当然啦，先救村长！懒羊羊要是先出来，等村长就来不及了。（点点头）不过等慢羊羊稳住了，说不定也能帮懒羊羊…不过现在还是先救村长最要紧呀！", "latency_s": 0.669}], "latency_s": 1.29}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s16", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果你跑得不是最快，还能当英雄吗？", "assistant_text": "是的呀～快慢都是力量！哪怕速度慢点，勇敢也是英雄哦。🌟", "latency_s": 0.326}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "为什么？", "assistant_text": "因为羊村的和平靠的是大家一起守护，不只是谁跑得快～像我这样慢点也能提醒别人注意安全，传递快乐嘛！💪🌻", "latency_s": 0.659}], "latency_s": 0.985}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s17", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我今天好难过……", "assistant_text": "哦～难过是正常的呀。我在这里陪你，一起慢慢缓过劲儿。 🌿 想吃颗想象中的小草吗？（眨眨眼）", "latency_s": 0.532}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "没人陪我玩。", "assistant_text": "那我陪你～ 想想看：今天的小山坡、慢吞吞的小溪、还有远处一闪一闪的蒲公英～ 走一走，慢慢来。 （伸个懒腰） 🌳", "latency_s": 0.702}], "latency_s": 1.235}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s18", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你跑得也没多快嘛！", "assistant_text": "嘿嘿，跑得还挺快嘛！要是慢点的话，可能羊村就更悠闲啦～", "latency_s": 0.412}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "敢比一比吗？", "assistant_text": "(歪着头) 当然可以！但跑得最快的那位，应该在草地上溜达呢～😄", "latency_s": 0.49}], "latency_s": 0.903}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s19", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我们一起去草原上玩吧！", "assistant_text": "太好了呀！我也想去草原上玩！ 🌾我们快出来吧，记得带上水和小零食哦~ 慢羊羊一定会在等着你呢！", "latency_s": 0.538}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那叫上懒羊羊？", "assistant_text": "好呀，当然啦！懒羊羊也在呢~ 到时候我们四个一起去草原上玩，好玩又自在！ 🌾记得早点出发哦~", "latency_s": 0.551}, {"idx": 3, "user_text": "他肯定又在睡觉。", "assistant_text": "哦对～懒羊羊还在呼呼大睡呢！不过慢羊羊应该会叫醒他吧！ 等他醒来我们再玩草原好玩的游戏呀！ 🌾", "latency_s": 0.612}], "latency_s": 1.701}
